  "description": "Active leased credentials from Azure/AWS/Database secret engines, polled live from Vault's lease store. This is NOT folded from the audit log: the audit log never records lease expiry (verified; see the repo's lease-visibility spec). scripts/vault-lease-inventory.py polls sys/leases/lookup directly instead.",
