      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"padding:8px 12px;background:#eef4fa;border-left:4px solid #006d9c;color:#333;font-family:inherit;\"><b>Live-polled, not audit-folded.</b> Vault's audit log never records lease expiry, at any layer (verified against a real issued credential). This dashboard polls the live lease store instead. <b>Only the Database engine has been verified end to end.</b> AWS and Azure use the same poller but their audit/API shapes are unconfirmed; rows from those engines are flagged.</div>"
      }
    },
